        "fix": "Built lib/gap-priority.js -- composite gap priority, bottom-up/architecture-first, reusing real KERNELS vitality data, loom real dependency graph, and diagnostic-engines real tension/SNR. Found and fixed 3 real bugs while building it: a wrong wire field name (w.to vs w.to_hook_id, silently returning empty data every time), a cli/ path regex missing the start-of-string case, and requiring autopilot.js live had real ungated side effects (a live ResourceMonitor + event fan-in) -- switched to a small static duplicate of the real vitality data instead.",
