      {
        "uuid": "783f1d0f-6a9e-4280-b77a-8e6aa4ca3975",
        "type": "fix-log",
        "domain": "system",
        "body": "Built lib/system-check.js -- the real bottom-up, architecture-first boot check (core/cli/api/events/ui, systems ordered by real vitality, cortex first). Found and fixed a real bug by testing against the real repo, not assumed: a generic core-layer heuristic produced false core:false for guardian (real entry guardian/server.js) and orchestrator (real entry orchestrator.js at root) -- switched to the real, known entry file per system (from KERNELS own args), generic heuristic only as a fallback for an unrecognized system.",
        "source": "cortex",
        "severity": "high",
        "status": "closed",
        "causedBy": null,
